msgid "## 4 Installation"
msgstr "## 4 安装"

msgid "## 5 Online Service Deployment"
msgstr "## 5 在线服务部署"

msgid ""
"Do not set `enable_thinking: false` / `thinking: false` for GLM-5.3-Flash, "
"otherwise the output quality may degrade."
msgstr ""
"请勿为 GLM-5.3-Flash 设置 `enable_thinking: false` / `thinking: "
"false`，否则输出质量可能会下降。"

msgid "### 5.1 Single-Node Online Deployment"
msgstr "### 5.1 单节点在线部署"

msgid "Run the following script to execute online inference."
msgstr "运行以下脚本执行在线推理。"

msgid ""
"Only the key parameters specific to this model/scenario are described below."
" `max-model-len` and `max-num-seqs` need to be set according to the actual "
"usage scenario."
msgstr "下面仅描述该模型/场景特有的关键参数。`max-model-len` 和 `max-num-seqs` 需要根据实际使用场景进行设置。"

msgid "**Model-specific parameters:**"
msgstr "**模型特有参数：**"

msgid "### 5.2 Multi-Node Colocated Deployment"
msgstr "### 5.2 多节点混部部署"

msgid "Run the following scripts on two nodes respectively."
msgstr "分别在两个节点上运行以下脚本。"

msgid "**Multi-node network and data parallel configuration:**"
msgstr "**多节点网络和数据并行配置：**"

msgid ""
"The launcher passes visible devices, engine port, global DP size, DP rank, DP\n"
"address, DP RPC port, and TP size to each role script as `$1` through `$7`."
msgstr ""
"启动器通过 `$1` 到 `$7` 向各角色脚本依次传入可见设备、引擎端口、全局 DP 大小、DP rank、DP 地址、DP RPC 端口和 TP "
"大小。"

msgid ""
"On the Prefill node, save the following script as `run_p.sh`. The launcher\n"
"    passes the visible devices, API port, DP configuration, and TP size as\n"
"    positional arguments."
msgstr ""
"在 Prefill 节点上，将以下脚本保存为 `run_p.sh`。启动器通过位置参数传入可见设备、API 端口、DP 配置和 TP 大小。"

msgid ""
"Start two DP2/TP8 Prefill engines. `--dp-address` uses the Prefill node IP.\n"
"    The launcher assigns API ports `9081-9082`."
msgstr ""
"启动 2 个 DP2/TP8 Prefill 引擎。`--dp-address` 使用 Prefill 节点的 IP 地址，启动器分配 API 端口 "
"`9081-9082`。"

msgid ""
"On the Decode node, save the following script as `run_d.sh`. Decode uses\n"
"    `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` graph mode for the target model, enables graph mode\n"
"    for the MTP draft model, and enables FlashComm1."
msgstr ""
"在 Decode 节点上，将以下脚本保存为 `run_d.sh`。Decode 为目标模型使用 `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` 图模式，为 MTP"
" 草稿模型启用图模式，并启用 FlashComm1。"

msgid "**Key Parameter Descriptions**"
msgstr "**关键参数说明**"

msgid ""
"Save the following script as `run_p.sh` on P0 and P1. The node wrappers\n"
"    below provide `LOCAL_IP` and the API/headless role."
msgstr ""
"将以下脚本保存为 P0 和 P1 上的 `run_p.sh`。下方的节点包装脚本提供 `LOCAL_IP` 及 API/headless 角色。"

msgid ""
"Save the following `run_p0.sh` on P0. P0 hosts the Prefill API endpoint."
msgstr "将以下 `run_p0.sh` 保存到 P0。P0 提供 Prefill API 端点。"

msgid "Save the following `run_p1.sh` on P1. P1 is the headless Prefill rank."
msgstr "将以下 `run_p1.sh` 保存到 P1。P1 是以 headless 模式运行的 Prefill rank。"

msgid "Start the two Prefill ranks with the shared launcher:"
msgstr "使用共享启动器启动两个 Prefill rank："

msgid ""
"Save the following `run_d.sh` on D0 and D1. Decode uses\n"
"    `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` graph mode for the target model and keeps FlashComm1\n"
"    disabled. The node wrappers below provide `LOCAL_IP`."
msgstr ""
"将以下 `run_d.sh` 保存到 D0 和 D1。Decode 为目标模型使用 `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` 图模式，并保持 "
"FlashComm1 禁用。下方的节点包装脚本提供 `LOCAL_IP`。"

msgid "Save the following `run_d0.sh` on D0:"
msgstr "将以下 `run_d0.sh` 保存到 D0："

msgid "Save the following `run_d1.sh` on D1:"
msgstr "将以下 `run_d1.sh` 保存到 D1："

msgid ""
"Start the services in this order: the first node of each group, the\n"
"    remaining nodes, then the proxy."
msgstr "按以下顺序启动服务：各组的第一个节点、其余节点、代理。"

msgid ""
"1. Complete the container and multi-node communication checks on all\n"
"       four nodes.\n"
"    2. Start P0 with the launcher command above (`--dp-rank-start 0`). P0\n"
"       hosts the Prefill API endpoint and the Prefill DP master.\n"
"    3. Start D0 with its launcher command (`--dp-rank-start 0`). D0 hosts\n"
"       the Decode DP master and four API endpoints.\n"
"    4. Immediately after launching P0 and D0, start P1 and D1 with their\n"
"       commands (`--dp-rank-start 1` and `--dp-rank-start 4`). Each DP group\n"
"       completes initialization after all its ranks have started.\n"
"    5. After all ten engines are ready, verify the API endpoints on P0, D0,\n"
"       and D1 with `curl http://127.0.0.1:<port>/v1/models` and check the\n"
"       headless P1 initialization logs. Start the proxy, then send requests\n"
"       to `<PREFILL_NODE0_IP>:8081`."
msgstr ""
"1. 完成全部四个节点的容器及多节点通信检查。\n"
"    2. 使用上方的启动器命令启动 P0（`--dp-rank-start 0`）。P0 提供 Prefill API 端点，并作为 Prefill DP 主节点。\n"
"    3. 使用对应的启动器命令启动 D0（`--dp-rank-start 0`）。D0 作为 Decode DP 主节点，并提供 4 个 API 端点。\n"
"    4. 启动 P0 和 D0 后，立即使用各自的命令启动 P1 和 D1（`--dp-rank-start 1` 和 `--dp-rank-start 4`）。每个 DP 组在其全部 rank 启动后完成初始化。\n"
"    5. 全部 10 个引擎就绪后，使用 `curl http://127.0.0.1:<port>/v1/models` 验证 P0、D0 和 D1 上的 API 端点，并检查 headless 节点 P1 的初始化日志。启动代理，然后向 `<PREFILL_NODE0_IP>:8081` 发送请求。"

msgid ""
"Open another terminal in one Prefill container and start the\n"
"    [load-balancing proxy](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/blob/main/examples/disaggregated_prefill_v1/load_balance_proxy_server_example.py).\n"
"    The proxy listens on port `8081`, sends Prefill requests to the P0 API\n"
"    endpoint, and forwards Decode work to the eight Decode endpoints."
msgstr ""
"在任一 Prefill 容器中打开另一个终端，启动[负载均衡代理](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/blob/main/examples/disaggregated_prefill_v1/load_balance_proxy_server_example.py)。代理监听端口"
" `8081`，将 Prefill 请求发送至 P0 API 端点，并将 Decode 工作转发至 8 个 Decode 端点。"

msgid "### 5.4 Prefill-Decode Disaggregation with KV Cache Pool"
msgstr ""
"### 5.4 使用 KV Cache 池的 Prefill-Decode 分离部署 {: #54-prefill-decode-"
"disaggregation-with-kv-cache-pool }"

msgid ""
"- `MooncakeConnectorV2` continues to transfer KV cache from Prefill to Decode.\n"
"- `AscendStoreConnector` lets Prefill look up, load, and save cached prefixes\n"
"  in the KV Cache Pool, reducing repeated Prefill computation."
msgstr ""
"- `MooncakeConnectorV2` 继续将 KV cache 从 Prefill 传输至 Decode。\n"
"- `AscendStoreConnector` 支持 Prefill 在 KV Cache 池中查询、加载和保存缓存前缀，减少重复的 Prefill 计算。"

msgid ""
"For backend installation, hardware dependencies, memory sizing, eviction,\n"
"and tenant options, refer to the [KV Cache Pool Deployment Guide](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md)."
msgstr ""
"有关后端安装、硬件依赖、内存大小、缓存淘汰和租户选项，请参阅 [KV Cache "
"池部署指南](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md)。"

msgid ""
"The `Location` field from `pip show` is `<PYTHON_SITE_PACKAGES>` in the\n"
"    commands below. Replace `<CONFIG_DIRECTORY>` with the absolute directory\n"
"    containing the configuration files on each node."
msgstr ""
"`pip show` 输出中的 `Location` 字段对应以下命令中的 `<PYTHON_SITE_PACKAGES>`。请将 "
"`<CONFIG_DIRECTORY>` 替换为各节点上存放配置文件的绝对路径。"

msgid ""
"This example stores pooled KV cache in DDR memory on both the Prefill\n"
"    and Decode nodes. The Memcache LocalService initializes within each vLLM\n"
"    worker, and each worker contributes `20GB` of DDR memory to the pool.\n"
"    Decode receives KV cache through `MooncakeConnectorV2`."
msgstr ""
"本示例在 Prefill 和 Decode 两个节点的 DDR 内存中存储池化 KV cache。Memcache LocalService 在各个 "
"vLLM worker 内部初始化，每个 worker 向池中贡献 `20GB` DDR 内存。Decode 通过 "
"`MooncakeConnectorV2` 接收 KV cache。"

msgid "On the Prefill node, create `mmc-meta.conf`:"
msgstr "在 Prefill 节点上创建 `mmc-meta.conf`："

msgid ""
"On both the Prefill and Decode nodes, create the following `mmc-local.conf`:"
msgstr "在 Prefill 和 Decode 两个节点上创建以下 `mmc-local.conf`："

msgid ""
"Keep `memcache_dp_init_barrier` set to `true` on every rank in each DP\n"
"    group. It synchronizes workers after Memcache initialization and before\n"
"    NPU graph capture. Set it in the `AscendStoreConnector` child, as shown\n"
"    above."
msgstr ""
"每个 DP 组的所有 rank 均须将 `memcache_dp_init_barrier` 设置为 `true`。它在 Memcache "
"初始化后、NPU 图捕获前同步 worker。请如上所示，将该参数设置在 `AscendStoreConnector` 子连接器中。"

msgid ""
"1. In a separate terminal in the Prefill container, start MetaService.\n"
"       Ensure ports `5000` and `6000` are reachable from both nodes and port\n"
"       `8000` is available for metrics."
msgstr ""
"1. 在 Prefill 容器中的独立终端启动 MetaService。确保两个节点均可访问端口 `5000` 和 `6000`，且指标端口 "
"`8000` 可用。"

msgid ""
"Warm up the pool through the proxy with a prompt longer than one cache\n"
"    block, then repeat requests with the same prefix. Check Prefill output for\n"
"    successful pool saves, lookups, loads, and cache hits, and check Decode\n"
"    output for successful P→D transfers."
msgstr ""
"通过代理发送长度超过一个缓存块的提示词以预热缓存池，然后重复发送具有相同前缀的请求。检查 Prefill "
"输出，确认缓存池保存、查询、加载和缓存命中成功；检查 Decode 输出，确认 P→D 传输成功。"

msgid ""
"The proxy distributes requests across two Prefill engines. A repeated\n"
"    request can also hit an engine's local prefix cache; confirm pool load/hit\n"
"    information on the other Prefill rank to verify shared pool reuse. Only\n"
"    complete, cacheable blocks are reused, so a partial trailing block can\n"
"    still require computation."
msgstr ""
"代理在两个 Prefill 引擎之间分发请求。重复请求也可能命中某个引擎的本地前缀缓存，因此需要在另一个 Prefill rank "
"上确认缓存池加载或命中信息，以验证共享池复用。只有完整且可缓存的块会被复用，末尾不完整的块仍可能需要计算。"

msgid ""
"For backend installation, memory sizing, eviction, and tenant options, refer\n"
"    to the [KV Cache Pool Deployment Guide](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md)."
msgstr ""
"有关后端安装、内存大小、缓存淘汰和租户选项，请参阅 [KV Cache "
"池部署指南](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md)。"

msgid ""
"On both Decode nodes, use the same JSON configuration with\n"
"    `global_segment_size` set to `0`. Use the same `tenant_id` on all four\n"
"    nodes. `global_segment_size` is registered per worker: with DP2/TP8\n"
"    spread across two Prefill nodes, each node starts 8 workers. The validated\n"
"    example uses `8GB` per worker, a `128GB` pool in total; adjust the\n"
"    per-worker size to the available host memory, keeping each non-zero segment\n"
"    size aligned to `1GB`. Keep `global_segment_size` at `0` in the Decode\n"
"    `mooncake.json`."
msgstr ""
"两个 Decode 节点使用相同的 JSON 配置，但将 `global_segment_size` 设置为 `0`。全部四个节点须使用相同的 "
"`tenant_id`。`global_segment_size` 按 worker 注册：DP2/TP8 分布在两个 Prefill "
"节点上，每个节点启动 8 个 worker。验证过的示例为每个 worker 分配 `8GB`，池总容量为 `128GB`。请根据可用主机内存调整每个 "
"worker 的容量，并保持每个非零段大小按 `1GB` 对齐。Decode 的 `mooncake.json` 中应保持 "
"`global_segment_size` 为 `0`。"

msgid ""
"Keep prefix caching and chunked prefill enabled. `use_layerwise` must\n"
"    remain `false` for this model: the GLM-5.3-Flash hybrid KV cache contains a\n"
"    non-prefix-cacheable group, and layer-wise pool transfer requires every\n"
"    group to be cacheable, so the pool stores and loads whole segments. No\n"
"    manual `--mamba-cache-mode` flag is needed either: when the connector list\n"
"    contains `AscendStoreConnector`, the engine switches the mamba cache mode to\n"
"    `align` automatically."
msgstr ""
"保持前缀缓存和分块预填充启用。此模型的 `use_layerwise` 必须保持为 `false`：GLM-5.3-Flash 的混合 KV cache"
" 包含不可进行前缀缓存的组，而逐层缓存池传输要求所有组均可缓存，因此缓存池按整段存储和加载。也无需手动设置 `--mamba-cache-mode` "
"参数：连接器列表包含 `AscendStoreConnector` 时，引擎会自动将 mamba 缓存模式切换为 `align`。"

msgid ""
"Start the services in this order: Mooncake Master → Decode → Prefill →\n"
"    Proxy."
msgstr "按以下顺序启动服务：Mooncake Master → Decode → Prefill → 代理。"

msgid ""
"1. In a separate terminal in the first Prefill container, start Mooncake\n"
"       Master. Ensure port `50088` is reachable from all four nodes."
msgstr "1. 在第一个 Prefill 容器中的独立终端启动 Mooncake Master，确保全部四个节点均可访问端口 `50088`。"

