msgid "## 9 Performance Tuning"
msgstr "## 9 性能调优"

msgid ""
"The following optimizations are already enabled in the reference configuration\n"
"in [Section 5.3](#53-1p1d-pd-disaggregated-deployment). Use the same W8A8 weights\n"
"and role-specific settings when reproducing the deployment."
msgstr ""
"[第 5.3 节](#53-1p1d-pd-disaggregated-deployment)的参考配置已启用以下优化。复现部署时，请使用相同的 "
"W8A8 权重和对应角色的配置。"

msgid "| Optimization | Role | Configuration | Purpose and constraints |"
msgstr "| 优化项 | 角色 | 配置 | 作用与约束 |"

msgid ""
"| FlashComm1 | Prefill and Decode | `enable_flashcomm1: true` | Optimizes "
"tensor-parallel communication. |"
msgstr ""
"| FlashComm1 | Prefill 和 Decode | `enable_flashcomm1: true` | 优化张量并行通信。 |"

msgid ""
"| DSA context parallelism | Prefill | `enable_dsa_cp: true` | Distributes "
"sparse-attention work for long prompts; use model runner V1. |"
msgstr ""
"| DSA 上下文并行 | Prefill | `enable_dsa_cp: true` | 分布式处理长提示词的稀疏注意力计算；使用模型运行器 "
"V1。 |"

msgid ""
"| Prefill MoE communication | Prefill | `enable_prefill_mc2: true`, "
"`enable_fused_mc2: 1`, `enable_shared_expert_dp: true` | Uses fused MoE "
"communication with the reference W8A8 weights and EP16 layout; keep "
"`multistream_overlap_shared_expert: false` on this role. |"
msgstr ""
"| Prefill MoE 通信 | Prefill | `enable_prefill_mc2: true`, `enable_fused_mc2: "
"1`, `enable_shared_expert_dp: true` | 使用参考配置中的 W8A8 权重和 EP16 布局进行融合 MoE "
"通信；该角色保持 `multistream_overlap_shared_expert: false`。 |"

msgid ""
"| Shared-expert overlap | Decode | `multistream_overlap_shared_expert: true`"
" | Overlaps shared-expert execution with other work; the Decode "
"configuration does not enable fused MC2. |"
msgstr ""
"| 共享专家重叠执行 | Decode | `multistream_overlap_shared_expert: true` | "
"将共享专家计算与其他工作重叠执行；Decode 配置未启用融合 MC2。 |"

msgid ""
"| Decode execution | Decode | `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` | Reduces decode launch "
"overhead. |"
msgstr "| Decode 执行 | Decode | `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` | 降低解码阶段的启动开销。 |"

msgid ""
"| MTP | Prefill and Decode | `num_speculative_tokens: 5` | Keeps the Prefill"
" draft in eager mode and enables draft graph execution on Decode. |"
msgstr ""
"| MTP | Prefill 和 Decode | `num_speculative_tokens: 5` | Prefill 草稿模型保持 "
"eager 模式，Decode 草稿模型启用图执行。 |"

msgid ""
"| KV capacity | Prefill and Decode | `--kv-cache-dtype int8` | Reduces KV "
"cache memory consumption for long contexts. |"
msgstr ""
"| KV 容量 | Prefill 和 Decode | `--kv-cache-dtype int8` | 减少长上下文场景下的 KV cache "
"内存消耗。 |"

msgid ""
"- Tune `--max-num-seqs` and `--max-num-batched-tokens` independently on each\n"
"  role. The reference uses 64 sequences and 4096 batched tokens on Prefill,\n"
"  and 32 sequences and 192 batched tokens on Decode. Measure time to first\n"
"  token, time per output token, and throughput before changing these limits.\n"
"- Set `--max-model-len` to the required context length and adjust\n"
"  `--gpu-memory-utilization` to the available NPU memory. The reference uses\n"
"  1048576 tokens and a utilization of 0.92 on both roles.\n"
"- Decode enables `recompute_scheduler_enable: true` to allow recomputation\n"
"  on Prefill when Decode KV cache is insufficient. Keep it disabled on Prefill.\n"
"- For repeated prefixes, use the DDR KV Cache Pool configuration in\n"
"  [Section 5.4](#54-prefill-decode-disaggregation-with-kv-cache-pool). Both\n"
"  Prefill and Decode contribute `20GB` per worker. Confirm pool hits when\n"
"  evaluating reuse benefits."
msgstr ""
"- 分别调节各角色的 `--max-num-seqs` 和 `--max-num-batched-tokens`。参考配置在 Prefill 上使用 64 条序列和 4096 个批处理 Token，在 Decode 上使用 32 条序列和 192 个批处理 Token。修改这些上限前，请先测量首 Token 时延、每个输出 Token 的时延和吞吐量。\n"
"- 根据所需上下文长度设置 `--max-model-len`，并根据可用 NPU 内存调节 `--gpu-memory-utilization`。参考配置在两个角色上均使用 1048576 个 Token 和 0.92 的内存利用率。\n"
"- Decode 启用 `recompute_scheduler_enable: true`，以便在 Decode KV cache 不足时在 Prefill 上重新计算。Prefill 上应保持禁用。\n"
"- 对于重复前缀，请使用[第 5.4 节](#54-prefill-decode-disaggregation-with-kv-cache-pool)中的 DDR KV Cache 池配置。Prefill 和 Decode 的每个 worker 均贡献 `20GB`。评估复用收益时，请确认池命中情况。"

msgid "## 10 FAQ"
msgstr "## 10 常见问题"

msgid "- **Q: How to enable function calling for GLM-5.3-Flash?**"
msgstr "- **问：如何为 GLM-5.3-Flash 启用函数调用？**"

msgid "- **Q: Does GLM-5.3-Flash support `enable_thinking: false`?**"
msgstr "- **问：GLM-5.3-Flash 是否支持 `enable_thinking: false`？**"

