msgstr "答：不支持，GLM-5.3-Flash 不支持 `enable_thinking`。"

msgid ""
"The \"PD Separation Deployment\" mentioned in this document is provided only"
" as an example/reference design to demonstrate the basic process of "
"deploying Prefill and Decode in separated mode. It is not recommended for "
"use in the production environment."
msgstr ""
"本文档中提到的“PD 分离部署”仅作为示例/参考设计提供，用于演示以分离模式部署 Prefill 和 Decode 的基本流程。不建议在生产环境中使用。"

msgid ""
"**For the production environment on the customer side, [MindIE "
"Motor](https://www.hiascend.com/document/detail/en/mindie/latest/quickstart/docs/en/user_guide/quick_start.md)"
" + vLLM-Ascend is recommended.**"
msgstr ""
"**对于客户侧的生产环境，推荐使用 [MindIE "
"Motor](https://www.hiascend.com/document/detail/zh/mindie/latest/quickstart/docs/zh/user_guide/quick_start.md)"
" + vLLM-Ascend。**"

msgid ""
"- `HCCL_IF_IP`, `GLOO_SOCKET_IFNAME`, `TP_SOCKET_IFNAME`, `HCCL_SOCKET_IFNAME`: Network interface configuration for multi-node communication. Set `nic_name` to the network interface name (obtained via `ifconfig`) and `local_ip` to the current node's IP address. These must be correctly configured on each node for successful multi-node communication.\n"
"- `--data-parallel-size 2 --data-parallel-size-local 1`: Runs two DP ranks across the two nodes, one rank per node; each rank uses TP8 within its node.\n"
"- `--data-parallel-start-rank`: Starting DP rank offset of the current node. Node 0 omits this option and automatically uses rank `0`; headless node 1 explicitly uses `1`.\n"
"- `--data-parallel-address`: IP address of the data parallel master node (node 0). Must match the `local_ip` of the master node.\n"
"- `--data-parallel-rpc-port 12321`: RPC port for data parallel master communication. Must be the same across all nodes.\n"
"- `--headless`: Indicates a non-master node (used on node 1). Do not use on node 0."
msgstr ""
"- `HCCL_IF_IP`、`GLOO_SOCKET_IFNAME`、`TP_SOCKET_IFNAME`、`HCCL_SOCKET_IFNAME`：用于多节点通信的网络接口配置。将 `nic_name` 设置为网络接口名称（通过 `ifconfig` 获取），将 `local_ip` 设置为当前节点的 IP 地址。必须在每个节点上正确配置这些参数，才能成功进行多节点通信。\n"
"- `--data-parallel-size 2 --data-parallel-size-local 1`：在两个节点上运行两个 DP rank，每个节点一个 rank；每个 rank 在其节点内使用 TP8。\n"
"- `--data-parallel-start-rank`：当前节点的起始 DP rank 偏移量。节点 0 省略此选项并自动使用 rank `0`；headless 节点 1 显式使用 `1`。\n"
"- `--data-parallel-address`：数据并行主节点（节点 0）的 IP 地址。必须与主节点的 `local_ip` 匹配。\n"
"- `--data-parallel-rpc-port 12321`：数据并行主节点通信的 RPC 端口。必须在所有节点上保持一致。\n"
"- `--headless`：表示非主节点（用于节点 1）。不要在节点 0 上使用。"

msgid ""
"Download the checkpoint from ModelScope for the hardware shown below. A3 and"
