msgstr "#### Ascend 950DT系列产品 {: #glm53-flash-5-3-950dt }"

msgid ""
"Start four TP4 Decode engines(total DP4). `--dp-address` uses the Decode node\n"
"    IP. The launcher assigns API ports `9900-9903`."
msgstr ""
"启动 4 个 TP4 Decode 引擎（总 DP4）。`--dp-address` 使用 Decode 节点的 IP 地址，启动器分配 API 端口 "
"`9900-9903`。"

msgid ""
"After all Prefill and Decode engines are ready, open another terminal in\n"
"    the Prefill container and start the\n"
"    [load-balancing proxy](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/blob/main/examples/disaggregated_prefill_v1/load_balance_proxy_server_example.py).\n"
"    The proxy listens on port `8081`, distributes requests across Prefill\n"
"    endpoints `9081-9082`, and then forwards Decode work to endpoints\n"
"    `9900-9903`."
msgstr ""
"所有 Prefill 和 Decode 引擎就绪后，在 Prefill "
"容器中打开另一个终端，启动[负载均衡代理](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/blob/main/examples/disaggregated_prefill_v1/load_balance_proxy_server_example.py)。代理监听端口"
" `8081`，将请求分发至 Prefill 端点 `9081-9082`，再将 Decode 工作转发至端点 `9900-9903`。"

msgid ""
"Start four TP2 engines on each Decode node(total DP8). `--dp-rank-start` is\n"
"    `0` on D0 and `4` on D1. `--dp-address` is D0's IP on both nodes, and\n"
"    the launcher assigns API ports `9900-9903` on each node."
msgstr ""
"在每个 Decode 节点上启动 4 个 TP2 引擎（两节点合计 DP8）。D0 的 `--dp-rank-start` 为 `0`，D1 为 "
"`4`。两个节点的 `--dp-address` 均为 D0 的 IP 地址，启动器为每个节点分配 API 端口 `9900-9903`。"

msgid ""
"`dram.size` specifies the DDR capacity allocated per worker. Prefill\n"
"    (DP2/TP8) and Decode (DP4/TP4) each start 16 workers. At `20GB` per worker,\n"
"    each node contributes `320GB`, for a total DDR pool capacity of `640GB`.\n"
"    Reserve sufficient DDR memory for the operating system and vLLM. For\n"
"    `device_sdma`, keep each non-zero size aligned to `1GB`."
msgstr ""
"`dram.size` 指定为每个 worker 分配的 DDR 容量。Prefill（DP2/TP8）和 Decode（DP4/TP4）各启动 16 "
"个 worker。每个 worker 分配 `20GB` 时，每个节点贡献 `320GB`，DDR 池总容量为 `640GB`。请为操作系统和 vLLM"
" 预留足够的 DDR 内存。使用 `device_sdma` 时，每个非零容量值均需按 `1GB` 对齐。"

msgid ""
"This example uses two A3 series servers. The Prefill node runs two\n"
"    DP ranks with TP8 (DP2/TP8), and the Decode node runs four DP ranks\n"
"    with TP4 (DP4/TP4). Both layouts consume all 16 logical devices on their\n"
"    respective servers. `MooncakeConnectorV2` transfers KV cache from the\n"
"    Prefill engines to the Decode engines."
msgstr ""
"本例使用两台 A3 系列服务器。Prefill 节点运行 2 个 TP8 DP rank（DP2/TP8），Decode 节点运行 4 个 TP4 DP"
" rank（DP4/TP4），各自使用所在服务器的全部 16 个逻辑设备。`MooncakeConnectorV2` 将 KV 缓存从 Prefill "
"引擎传输到 Decode 引擎。"

msgid ""
"- `--data-parallel-size` and `--tensor-parallel-size` define DP2/TP8 on\n"
"      Prefill and DP4/TP4 on Decode. Both layouts use all 16 logical devices\n"
"      on their respective A3 series nodes.\n"
"    - `--data-parallel-address` and `--data-parallel-rpc-port` coordinate DP\n"
"      ranks within one role. Prefill and Decode use their respective node IPs.\n"
"      The default RPC port `12325` can be reused because the roles run on\n"
"      different hosts.\n"
"    - `--vllm-start-port 9081` assigns API ports `9081-9082` on Prefill, while\n"
"      `--vllm-start-port 9900` assigns `9900-9903` on Decode. All endpoints\n"
"      must be reachable from the proxy.\n"
"    - Both roles use `--max-model-len 1048576`, `--kv-cache-dtype int8`, and\n"
"      MTP speculative decoding with three speculative tokens. The MTP draft\n"
"      model uses `enforce_eager: true` on Prefill and `enforce_eager: false`\n"
"      on Decode.\n"
"    - `VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=0` explicitly selects model runner V1 on both\n"
"      roles for this configuration.\n"
"    - Prefill uses `--max-num-seqs 64` and\n"
"      `--max-num-batched-tokens 4096`. Decode uses `--max-num-seqs 32` and\n"
"      `--max-num-batched-tokens 192`. Tune these role-specific scheduler limits\n"
"      independently for the target workload.\n"
"    - Prefill sets `--prefix-cache-retention-interval None`. For KV Cache\n"
"      Pool deployment, apply the prefix-caching changes in Section 5.4.\n"
"    - Decode uses `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` graph mode. Both roles explicitly\n"
"      enable FlashComm1.\n"
"    - Prefill sets `enable_dsa_cp: true`, `enable_prefill_mc2: true`,\n"
"      `enable_fused_mc2: 1`, and `enable_shared_expert_dp: true`, with\n"
"      `multistream_overlap_shared_expert: false`. Decode sets\n"
"      `multistream_overlap_shared_expert: true`,\n"
"      `enable_shared_expert_dp: true`, and `recompute_scheduler_enable: true`.\n"
"    - Both Prefill and Decode use `--limit-mm-per-prompt '{\"image\":1,\"video\":0}'`, allowing\n"
"      at most one image per prompt and disabling video input.\n"
"    - `MooncakeConnectorV2` transfers KV cache between the two roles.\n"
"      `kv_role` must be `kv_producer` on Prefill and `kv_consumer` on Decode.\n"
"      The role-specific KV ports must be available on their respective hosts.\n"
"    - `ASCEND_GLOBAL_RESOURCE_CONFIG` selects `hccs:device`, and\n"
"      `ASCEND_LOCAL_COMM_RES` sets resource configuration version `1.2` for\n"
"      this HCCS supernode. `HCCL_IF_IP` and all socket interface variables must\n"
"      select the host network used by the configured node IPs. The DP RPC,\n"
"      engine, Mooncake, and proxy ports must be allowed by the host firewall."
msgstr ""
"- `--data-parallel-size` 与 `--tensor-parallel-size` 定义 Prefill DP2/TP8、Decode DP4/TP4；两端均使用各自 A3 系列节点的全部 16 个逻辑设备。\n"
"    - `--data-parallel-address` 与 `--data-parallel-rpc-port` 协调同一角色内的 DP rank。Prefill 和 Decode 使用各自节点 IP，因运行在不同主机，可复用默认 RPC 端口 `12325`。\n"
"    - `--vllm-start-port 9081` 在 Prefill 分配 API 端口 `9081-9082`，`--vllm-start-port 9900` 在 Decode 分配 `9900-9903`。所有端点必须能从代理访问。\n"
"    - 两端均使用 `--max-model-len 1048576`、`--kv-cache-dtype int8`，以及 3 个推测 Token 的 MTP 解码。Prefill 草稿模型使用 `enforce_eager: true`，Decode 使用 `enforce_eager: false`。\n"
"    - 两端通过 `VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=0` 显式选择 V1 模型运行器。\n"
"    - Prefill 使用 `--max-num-seqs 64`、`--max-num-batched-tokens 4096`；Decode 使用 `--max-num-seqs 32`、`--max-num-batched-tokens 192`。应按目标负载分别调整角色专属调度限制。\n"
"    - Prefill 设置 `--prefix-cache-retention-interval None`。KV 缓存池部署请按第 5.4 节修改前缀缓存设置。\n"
"    - Decode 使用 `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` 图模式，两端均显式启用 FlashComm1。\n"
"    - Prefill 设置 `enable_dsa_cp: true`、`enable_prefill_mc2: true`、`enable_fused_mc2: 1`、`enable_shared_expert_dp: true` 和 `multistream_overlap_shared_expert: false`；Decode 设置 `multistream_overlap_shared_expert: true`、`enable_shared_expert_dp: true` 及 `recompute_scheduler_enable: true`。\n"
"    - Prefill、Decode 均使用 `--limit-mm-per-prompt '{\"image\":1,\"video\":0}'`，每提示词最多一张图片，禁用视频输入。\n"
"    - `MooncakeConnectorV2` 在两种角色间传输 KV 缓存。Prefill 的 `kv_role` 必须为 `kv_producer`，Decode 为 `kv_consumer`；各自主机必须开放角色对应的 KV 端口。\n"
"    - `ASCEND_GLOBAL_RESOURCE_CONFIG` 选择 `hccs:device`，`ASCEND_LOCAL_COMM_RES` 为此 HCCS 超节点设置资源配置版本 `1.2`。`HCCL_IF_IP` 及全部套接字网卡变量应选择配置节点 IP 所属的主机网络。主机防火墙必须放行 DP RPC、引擎、Mooncake 和代理端口。"

msgid ""
"- A2 series uses global DP2/TP8 Prefill and DP8/TP2 Decode, with each\n"
"      role spread across two nodes with eight devices per node. A3 series uses\n"
"      DP2/TP8 Prefill and DP4/TP4 Decode, each on one node with 16 logical devices.\n"
"    - P0 and P1 use the shared launcher with one local DP rank each. P0\n"
"      exposes the Prefill API with `--api-server-count 1`; P1 is headless.\n"
"      D0 and D1 each run four API-serving TP2 engines(total DP8) through their\n"
"      node-specific wrapper scripts.\n"
"    - `kv_connector_extra_config` enables `use_ascend_direct` for direct\n"
"      NPU-to-NPU KV transfer and declares the actual Prefill and Decode\n"
"      `{dp_size, tp_size}` topology. The declared values must match the\n"
"      real deployment.\n"
"    - Prefill uses `--max-num-seqs 64` and `--max-num-batched-tokens 8192`\n"
"      with `--enforce-eager`; Decode uses `--max-num-seqs 32` and\n"
"      `--max-num-batched-tokens 1024` with `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` graph mode.\n"
"      Both roles run with `--async-scheduling`.\n"
"    - Both roles rely on model runner V1 via\n"
"      `VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=0`, consistent with the other tabs in\n"
"      this guide. `VLLM_HOST_IP` advertises the IP that peers use to\n"
"      reach each engine for KV transfer.\n"
"    - MTP speculative decoding uses three speculative tokens on A2 series.\n"
"      `enforce_eager: true` keeps the MTP draft model in eager mode.\n"
"    - `HCCL_HOST_SOCKET_PORT_RANGE` and `HCCL_NPU_SOCKET_PORT_RANGE` on\n"
"      Decode reserve a disjoint 100-port window per DP rank (starting at\n"
"      `60000 + rank * 100`). When several engines share one node, these\n"
"      ranges prevent the HCCL host-side sockets from silently sharing\n"
"      ports across ranks, which can block engine startup.\n"
"    - The remaining timeout and runtime variables\n"
"      (`VLLM_EXECUTE_MODEL_TIMEOUT_SECONDS`, `HCCL_EXEC_TIMEOUT`,\n"
"      `HCCL_CONNECT_TIMEOUT`, `VLLM_RPC_TIMEOUT`, `OMP_PROC_BIND`,\n"
"      `OMP_NUM_THREADS`) are the validated A2 series startup defaults for this\n"
"      model size; keep them unless your environment requires different\n"
"      values.\n"
"    - `HCCL_IF_IP` and all socket interface variables must select the\n"
"      service network used by the configured node IPs. The DP RPC,\n"
"      engine, Mooncake, and proxy ports must be allowed by the host\n"
"      firewall."
msgstr ""
"- A2 系列使用全局 Prefill DP2/TP8、Decode DP8/TP2，每角色分布在两个节点上，每节点 8 个设备。A3 系列使用 Prefill DP2/TP8、Decode DP4/TP4，每角色占一个含 16 个逻辑设备的节点。\n"
"    - P0、P1 使用共用启动器，各有一个本地 DP rank。P0 通过 `--api-server-count 1` 提供 Prefill API，P1 不提供 API。D0、D1 分别通过节点专属封装脚本运行 4 个提供 API 的 TP2 引擎（两节点合计 DP8）。\n"
"    - `kv_connector_extra_config` 启用 `use_ascend_direct`，直接在 NPU 间传输 KV，并声明实际 Prefill、Decode 的 `{dp_size, tp_size}` 拓扑；声明值必须与实际部署一致。\n"
"    - Prefill 使用 `--max-num-seqs 64`、`--max-num-batched-tokens 8192` 及 `--enforce-eager`；Decode 使用 `--max-num-seqs 32`、`--max-num-batched-tokens 1024` 及 `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` 图模式。两端均启用 `--async-scheduling`。\n"
"    - 两端通过 `VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=0` 使用 V1 模型运行器，与本指南其他标签页一致。`VLLM_HOST_IP` 通告对端访问各引擎进行 KV 传输时使用的 IP。\n"
"    - A2 的 MTP 解码使用 3 个推测 Token，`enforce_eager: true` 使草稿模型保持 eager 模式。\n"
"    - Decode 的 `HCCL_HOST_SOCKET_PORT_RANGE` 和 `HCCL_NPU_SOCKET_PORT_RANGE` 为每个 DP rank 预留互不重叠的 100 端口窗口，起点为 `60000 + rank * 100`。多引擎共用节点时，这可避免不同 rank 的 HCCL 主机套接字隐式共用端口而阻塞启动。\n"
"    - 其余超时和运行时变量（`VLLM_EXECUTE_MODEL_TIMEOUT_SECONDS`、`HCCL_EXEC_TIMEOUT`、`HCCL_CONNECT_TIMEOUT`、`VLLM_RPC_TIMEOUT`、`OMP_PROC_BIND`、`OMP_NUM_THREADS`）是针对该模型规模验证过的 A2 启动默认值，除非环境需要，否则应保持不变。\n"
"    - `HCCL_IF_IP` 和全部套接字网卡变量应选择配置节点 IP 所属的业务网络。主机防火墙必须放行 DP RPC、引擎、Mooncake 和代理端口。"

msgid ""
"The following accuracy results were obtained using an earlier A3 series PD\n"
"configuration with DP2/TP8 on the Prefill node and DP8/TP2 on the Decode node.\n"
"Evaluation requests were sent through the PD proxy. The table below lists the\n"
"generation parameters used for each dataset. See [Section 5.3](#53-1p1d-pd-disaggregated-deployment)\n"
"for the current serving examples."
msgstr ""
"下列精度结果来自此前的 A3 系列 PD 配置，Prefill 节点为 DP2/TP8，Decode 节点为 DP8/TP2。评估请求通过 PD "
"代理发送，下表列出各数据集使用的生成参数。当前服务启动示例请参见[第 5.3 节](#53-1p1d-pd-disaggregated-"
"deployment)。"

msgid ""
"| `--reasoning-parser` | Separates reasoning from the final answer. Use "
"`glm47` for all examples on this page. |"
msgstr "| `--reasoning-parser` | 将推理过程与最终答案分离。本页所有示例均使用 `glm47`。 |"

msgid ""
"This document shows the main verification steps of the model, including "
"supported features, feature configuration, environment preparation, single-"
"node deployment, Prefill-Decode (PD) disaggregated deployment, multi-node "
"deployment, and accuracy and performance evaluation."
msgstr ""
"本文档介绍该模型的主要验证步骤，包括支持的特性、特性配置、环境准备、单机部署、Prefill-Decode（PD）分离部署、多机部署以及精度和性能评估。"

msgid ""
"GLM-5.3-Flash model currently supports only model runner V1 on Ascend, so\n"
"all deployment scripts on this page set `VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=0` explicitly."
msgstr ""
"GLM-5.3-Flash 模型目前在昇腾上仅支持 model runner V1，因此\n"
"本页所有部署脚本都显式设置了 `VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=0`。"

msgid ""
"| `GLM-5.3-Flash-w8a8-mxfp8` | 950DT products (96GB × 8 per node) | 1 node "
"for single-node deployment; 2 nodes for PD | "
"[ModelScope](https://www.modelscope.cn/models/Eco-"
"Tech/GLM-5.3-Flash-w8a8-mxfp8) | Supports a W8A8C8 configuration: C8 is "
"dynamic KV-cache quantization. Set `--kv-cache-dtype fp8` in the serving "
"command to enable FP8 KV cache; no separate C8 checkpoint is required. |"
msgstr ""
"| `GLM-5.3-Flash-w8a8-mxfp8` | Ascend 950DT系列产品（每节点 96GB × 8） | 单机部署使用 1 "
"个节点；PD 部署使用 2 个节点 | [ModelScope](https://www.modelscope.cn/models/Eco-"
"Tech/GLM-5.3-Flash-w8a8-mxfp8) | 支持 W8A8C8 配置：C8 为动态 KV-cache 量化。在服务命令中设置 "
"`--kv-cache-dtype fp8` 以启用 FP8 KV cache；无需单独的 C8 权重文件。 |"

msgid ""
"| `GLM-5.3-Flash-w8a8` | A3 series (64GB × 16) | 1 node for single-node "
"deployment; 2 nodes for PD | "
"[ModelScope](https://www.modelscope.cn/models/Eco-Tech/GLM-5.3-Flash-w8a8) |"
" Supports a W8A8C8 configuration: C8 is dynamic KV-cache quantization. Set "
"`--kv-cache-dtype int8` in the serving command to enable INT8 KV cache; no "
"separate C8 checkpoint is required. |"
msgstr ""
"| `GLM-5.3-Flash-w8a8` | Atlas A3系列产品（64GB × 16） | 单机部署使用 1 个节点；PD 部署使用 2 "
"个节点 | [ModelScope](https://www.modelscope.cn/models/Eco-"
"Tech/GLM-5.3-Flash-w8a8) | 支持 W8A8C8 配置：C8 为动态 KV-cache 量化。在服务命令中设置 `--kv-"
"cache-dtype int8` 以启用 INT8 KV cache；无需单独的 C8 权重文件。 |"

msgid ""
"The checkpoints linked above are already quantized and can be served "
"directly. For self-quantization, follow the installation and command "
"examples in the [msModelSlim quantization "
"guide](https://www.hiascend.com/document/detail/en/mindstudio/2610/TITools/msModelSlim/docs/en/user_guide/feature_guide/quick_quantization_v1/usage.md)"
" and select the configuration for the exact model and target hardware from "
"the [model "
"recipes](https://gitcode.com/Ascend/msmodelslim/tree/master/lab_practice). "
"Do not reuse a different model's YAML file."
msgstr ""
"上述链接的权重文件已完成量化，可直接用于服务。如需自行量化，请按照 [msModelSlim "
"量化指南](https://www.hiascend.com/document/detail/en/mindstudio/2610/TITools/msModelSlim/docs/en/user_guide/feature_guide/quick_quantization_v1/usage.md)"
" "
"中的安装和命令示例操作，并从[模型配方](https://gitcode.com/Ascend/msmodelslim/tree/master/lab_practice)中选择与具体模型和目标硬件相匹配的配置。请勿复用其他模型的"
" YAML 文件。"

msgid ""
"| `--safetensors-load-strategy prefetch` | Reads checkpoint files into the "
"operating system page cache before workers load them. It can help with "
"network or high-latency storage and needs sufficient host memory; it does "
"not preload weights into NPU memory. See [vLLM weight-loading "
"options](https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/configuration/engine_args/#--safetensors-"
"load-strategy). |"
msgstr ""
"| `--safetensors-load-strategy prefetch` | 在 worker "
"加载权重文件之前，先将其读入操作系统页缓存。这有助于应对网络存储或高延迟存储，且需要足够的主机内存；它不会将权重预加载到 NPU 内存中。参见 "
"[vLLM "
"权重加载选项](https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/configuration/engine_args/#--safetensors-"
"load-strategy)。 |"

msgid ""
"After starting all nodes of the selected deployment, open another terminal "
"and run `curl --fail <API_HOST>:<API_PORT>/health` against every API "
"endpoint. For single-node deployment use that node's API; for colocated A2 "
"use the API-serving master, since the headless node has no API. Wait for "
"successful responses before sending the [functional verification "
"requests](#6-functional-verification). Check the launch terminals on all "
"nodes if initialization fails."
msgstr ""
"启动所选部署的所有节点后，打开另一个终端，对每个 API 端点运行 `curl --fail "
"<API_HOST>:<API_PORT>/health`。单机部署使用该节点的 API；对于共置 A2 部署，使用提供 API "
"服务的主节点，因为无头节点没有 API。等待所有响应成功后再发送[功能验证请求](#6-functional-"
"verification)。如果初始化失败，请检查所有节点上的启动终端。"

msgid ""
"### 5.3 PD Disaggregated Deployment {: #53-1p1d-pd-disaggregated-deployment "
"}"
msgstr "### 5.3 PD 分离部署 {: #53-1p1d-pd-disaggregated-deployment }"

msgid ""
"Before starting any role script, verify [multi-node "
"communication](../../getting_started/installation.md#installation-multi-"
"node-interconnect), select the matching host IP and interface on every node,"
" and allow the DP RPC, API, HCCL socket, Mooncake handshake/control, and "
"transfer-engine ports through the firewall. Use the port settings in the "
"selected hardware tab; allowing only the proxy port is insufficient. "
"Physical node count and the number of DP engines are different: follow each "
"tab's topology and endpoint mapping."
msgstr ""
"在启动任何角色脚本之前，请验证[多机通信](../../getting_started/installation.md#installation-"
"multi-node-interconnect)，在每个节点上选择匹配的主机 IP 和网卡，并在防火墙中放行 DP RPC、API、HCCL "
"socket、Mooncake 握手/控制以及传输引擎端口。请使用所选硬件标签页中的端口设置；仅放行代理端口是不够的。物理节点数与 DP "
"引擎数量不同：请遵循各标签页中的拓扑和端点映射。"

msgid ""
"Start Decode first, then Prefill. In another terminal, check "
"`<DECODE_NODE_IP>:9900/health` through port `9903` and "
"`<PREFILL_NODE_IP>:9081/health` through port `9082` with `curl --fail`. "
