msgstr "<a id=\"glm53-flash-a2-proxy\"></a>"

msgid ""
"Reuse the A3 series DP2/TP8 Prefill and DP4/TP4 Decode topology, launcher, and\n"
"    proxy endpoint mapping from [Section 5.3](#glm53-flash-5-3-a3)."
msgstr ""
"复用 [第 5.3 节](#glm53-flash-5-3-a3)中 Atlas A3系列产品的 DP2/TP8 Prefill 和 DP4/TP4 Decode 拓扑、启动器以及\n"
"    代理端点映射。"

msgid ""
"Follow [Scenario 2: Memcache Backend](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md#scenario-2-memcache-backend)\n"
"    for prerequisite checks and memory sizing. The A3 series HCCS\n"
"    configuration uses `device_sdma`, which requires LingQu Computing Network\n"
"    1.5 or later. Also check the HDK and CANN requirements in the guide's\n"
"    [HDK and CANN Version Compatibility Reference](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md#hdk-and-cann-version-compatibility-reference)."
msgstr ""
"请按照[场景 2：Memcache 后端](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md#scenario-2-memcache-backend)\n"
"    进行前置条件检查和内存规划。Atlas A3系列产品的 HCCS\n"
"    配置使用 `device_sdma`，这要求灵衢计算网络\n"
"    1.5 或更高版本。另请查看指南中的\n"
"    [HDK 与 CANN 版本兼容性参考](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md#hdk-and-cann-version-compatibility-reference)中的 HDK 和 CANN 要求。"

msgid ""
"LingQu Computing Network is a host-side platform prerequisite for "
"`device_sdma`, not the version of the Memcache Python package. Before "
"starting the containers, have the platform administrator check the installed"
" LingQu release against the server's vendor installation records and confirm"
" version 1.5 or later together with the HDK/CANN compatibility matrix linked"
" above. Installing or upgrading `memcache-hybrid` alone does not establish "
"this prerequisite."
msgstr ""
"灵衢计算网络是 `device_sdma` 的主机侧平台前置条件，而不是 Memcache Python "
"包的版本。在启动容器之前，请让平台管理员根据服务器的厂商安装记录核对已安装的灵衢版本，并结合上文链接的 HDK/CANN 兼容性矩阵确认版本为 1.5 "
"或更高。仅安装或升级 `memcache-hybrid` 并不能满足此前提条件。"

msgid ""
"**When starting the A3 series containers on both Prefill and Decode nodes, "
"you must include the following read-only mount in the Docker command from "
"Section 4:**"
msgstr ""
"**在 Prefill 和 Decode 节点上启动 Atlas A3系列产品容器时，必须在第 4 节的 Docker 命令中包含以下只读挂载：**"

msgid ""
"`world_size` is the maximum number of LocalServices supported by Memcache.\n"
"    Keep it consistent across all workers and large enough for the 32 workers\n"
"    in this deployment."
msgstr ""
"`world_size` 是 Memcache 支持的最大 LocalService 数量。\n"
"    请在所有 worker 之间保持一致，并确保其足够大，以容纳此部署中的 32 个 worker。"

msgid ""
"In both `run_p.sh` and `run_d.sh`, keep the [Section 5.3](#glm53-flash-5-3-a3) environment variables\n"
"    and add the following exports before `exec vllm serve`:"
msgstr ""
"在 `run_p.sh` 和 `run_d.sh` 中，保留 [第 5.3 节](#glm53-flash-5-3-a3) 的环境变量，\n"
"    并在 `exec vllm serve` 之前添加以下导出："

msgid ""
"Use the same `PYTHONHASHSEED` and Memcache service endpoints on both nodes.\n"
"    Keep the HCCS communication settings from [Section 5.3](#glm53-flash-5-3-a3), including\n"
"    `ASCEND_GLOBAL_RESOURCE_CONFIG` and `ASCEND_LOCAL_COMM_RES`."
msgstr ""
"在两个节点上使用相同的 `PYTHONHASHSEED` 和 Memcache 服务端点。\n"
"    保留 [第 5.3 节](#glm53-flash-5-3-a3) 中的 HCCS 通信设置，包括\n"
"    `ASCEND_GLOBAL_RESOURCE_CONFIG` 和 `ASCEND_LOCAL_COMM_RES`。"

msgid ""
"For A3 series KV Cache Pool deployment, add `--enable-prefix-caching` to both\n"
"    `run_p.sh` and `run_d.sh` in [Section 5.3](#glm53-flash-5-3-a3), and keep\n"
"    chunked prefill enabled (the model default). GLM-5.3-Flash has\n"
"    linear-attention state, and `AscendStoreConnector`\n"
"    requires `mamba_cache_mode=align`; the model configuration selects this mode\n"
"    when prefix caching is enabled. Keep the hybrid KV cache manager enabled\n"
"    and `use_layerwise` disabled for this configuration."
msgstr ""
"对于 Atlas A3系列产品的 KV Cache Pool 部署，在 [第 5.3 节](#glm53-flash-5-3-a3) 中为\n"
"    `run_p.sh` 和 `run_d.sh` 都添加 `--enable-prefix-caching`，并保持\n"
"    分块预填充（chunked prefill）启用（模型默认值）。GLM-5.3-Flash 具有\n"
"    线性注意力状态，而 `AscendStoreConnector`\n"
"    要求 `mamba_cache_mode=align`；启用前缀缓存时，模型配置会选择此模式。\n"
"    对于此配置，保持混合 KV cache 管理器启用，\n"
"    并禁用 `use_layerwise`。"

msgid ""
"Replace the final `--kv-transfer-config` argument in `run_p.sh` with the\n"
"    following fragment. Apart from the prefix-caching change above, keep\n"
"    the remaining A3 series Prefill flags from [Section 5.3](#glm53-flash-5-3-a3), including\n"
"    `--max-num-seqs 64`."
msgstr ""
"将 `run_p.sh` 中最后的 `--kv-transfer-config` 参数替换为\n"
"    以下片段。除上述前缀缓存更改外，保留\n"
"    [第 5.3 节](#glm53-flash-5-3-a3) 中其余的 Atlas A3系列产品 Prefill 标志，包括\n"
"    `--max-num-seqs 64`。"

msgid ""
"Replace the final `--kv-transfer-config` argument in `run_d.sh` with the\n"
"    following fragment. Apart from the prefix-caching change above, keep\n"
"    the remaining A3 series Decode flags from [Section 5.3](#glm53-flash-5-3-a3), including\n"
"    `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` graph mode and the MTP configuration."
msgstr ""
"将 `run_d.sh` 中最后的 `--kv-transfer-config` 参数替换为\n"
"    以下片段。除上述前缀缓存更改外，保留\n"
"    [第 5.3 节](#glm53-flash-5-3-a3) 中其余的 Atlas A3系列产品 Decode 标志，包括\n"
"    `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` 图模式以及 MTP 配置。"

msgid ""
"`$4` is the DP rank passed by `launch_online_dp.py`. Each engine must have a\n"
"    unique `lookup_rpc_port`. The Prefill lookup values are `37000-37001`, and the\n"
"    Decode lookup values are `37100-37103`. Keep the role-specific Mooncake KV\n"
"    base ports from [Section 5.3](#glm53-flash-5-3-a3); its workers and schedulers derive their own\n"
"    ports from the topology."
msgstr ""
"`$4` 是由 `launch_online_dp.py` 传入的 DP rank。每个引擎必须具有\n"
"    唯一的 `lookup_rpc_port`。Prefill 的 lookup 值为 `37000-37001`，\n"
"    Decode 的 lookup 值为 `37100-37103`。保留 [第 5.3 节](#glm53-flash-5-3-a3) 中\n"
"    各角色专用的 Mooncake KV 基础端口；其 worker 和 scheduler 会根据拓扑\n"
"    自行推导各自的端口。"

msgid ""
"Start the services in this order: Memcache MetaService → Decode → Prefill → Proxy. \n"
"    Each vLLM worker initializes its Memcache LocalService during startup."
msgstr ""
"按以下顺序启动服务：Memcache MetaService → Decode → Prefill → Proxy。\n"
"    每个 vLLM worker 在启动期间会初始化其 Memcache LocalService。"

msgid ""
"2. Start Decode with the [A3 series launcher command in Section 5.3](#glm53-flash-a3-decode-command). Wait until\n"
"       all four Decode engines on ports `9900-9903` are ready and their\n"
"       Memcache LocalServices have reserved the configured DDR pool memory.\n"
"    3. Start Prefill with the [A3 series launcher command in Section 5.3](#glm53-flash-a3-prefill-command). Wait until\n"
"       both Prefill engines on ports `9081-9082` are ready and their Memcache\n"
"       LocalServices have reserved the configured DDR pool memory.\n"
"    4. Start the [A3 series proxy from Section 5.3](#glm53-flash-a3-proxy). Send inference requests to\n"
"       `<PREFILL_NODE_IP>:8081` using the examples in [Section 6](#6-functional-verification)."
msgstr ""
"2. 使用 [第 5.3 节中的 Atlas A3系列产品启动器命令](#glm53-flash-a3-decode-command) 启动 Decode。等待\n"
"       端口 `9900-9903` 上的全部四个 Decode 引擎就绪，并且其\n"
"       Memcache LocalService 已预留配置的 DDR 池内存。\n"
"    3. 使用 [第 5.3 节中的 Atlas A3系列产品启动器命令](#glm53-flash-a3-prefill-command) 启动 Prefill。等待\n"
"       端口 `9081-9082` 上的两个 Prefill 引擎就绪，并且其 Memcache\n"
"       LocalService 已预留配置的 DDR 池内存。\n"
"    4. 启动 [第 5.3 节中的 Atlas A3系列产品代理](#glm53-flash-a3-proxy)。使用 [第 6 节](#6-functional-verification) 中的示例\n"
"       向 `<PREFILL_NODE_IP>:8081` 发送推理请求。"

msgid "<a id=\"glm53-flash-pool-reuse\"></a>"
msgstr "<a id=\"glm53-flash-pool-reuse\"></a>"

msgid ""
"Capture the Prefill launcher's standard output and standard error when "
"starting the service. Compare `vllm:ascend_store_load_get_keys_total` at "
"each Prefill API's `/metrics` endpoint before and after repeating the prefix"
" on the other Prefill rank: an increase records pool GET keys, unlike a "
"local prefix-cache hit alone. Also verify that requests complete "
"successfully; a GET counter alone does not prove a successful transfer or an"
" accuracy result."
msgstr ""
"启动服务时捕获 Prefill 启动器的标准输出和标准错误。在另一个 Prefill rank 上重复该前缀之前和之后，比较每个 Prefill API"
" 的 `/metrics` 端点上的 `vllm:ascend_store_load_get_keys_total`：该值增加表示记录了池 GET "
"键，这与仅命中本地前缀缓存不同。同时验证请求是否成功完成；仅凭 GET 计数器不能证明传输成功或精度结果。"

msgid ""
"Reuse the `launch_online_dp.py` launcher, the P0/P1 and D0/D1 scripts, the\n"
"    DP2/TP8 Prefill and DP8/TP2 Decode topology, and the proxy configuration from\n"
"    [Section 5.3](#glm53-flash-5-3-a2). A2 series nodes do not have the A3 series HCCS fabric: the\n"
"    pool runs over the A2 series RoCE network with the `P2PHANDSHAKE` metadata server\n"
"    and the `ascend` protocol, and the A3 series fabric-memory exports do not apply."
msgstr ""
"复用 `launch_online_dp.py` 启动器、P0/P1 和 D0/D1 脚本、\n"
"    DP2/TP8 Prefill 与 DP8/TP2 Decode 拓扑，以及\n"
"    [第 5.3 节](#glm53-flash-5-3-a2) 中的代理配置。Atlas A2系列产品节点没有 Atlas A3系列产品的 HCCS 互联：\n"
"    该池通过 Atlas A2系列产品的 RoCE 网络运行，使用 `P2PHANDSHAKE` 元数据服务器\n"
"    和 `ascend` 协议，Atlas A3系列产品的 fabric-memory 导出不适用。"

msgid ""
"Retain the Prefill internal-LB settings from [Section 5.3](#glm53-flash-5-3-a2), including\n"
"    P1's `--headless --data-parallel-start-rank 1` wrapper and the P0-only\n"
"    proxy endpoint. The pool fragments derive distinct lookup ports from `$4`;\n"
"    this does not require adding `--data-parallel-rank` to the Prefill serving\n"
"    command."
msgstr ""
"保留 [第 5.3 节](#glm53-flash-5-3-a2) 中的 Prefill 内部负载均衡（internal-LB）设置，包括\n"
"    P1 的 `--headless --data-parallel-start-rank 1` 包装器以及仅 P0 的\n"
"    代理端点。池片段从 `$4` 推导出不同的 lookup 端口；\n"
"    这不需要在 Prefill 服务命令中添加 `--data-parallel-rank`。"

msgid ""
"In both `run_p.sh` and `run_d.sh`, keep the [Section 5.3](#glm53-flash-5-3-a2) environment\n"
"    variables and add the following exports before `exec vllm serve`. Replace\n"
"    `<CONFIG_DIRECTORY>` with the absolute directory containing that node's\n"
"    `mooncake.json`."
msgstr ""
"在 `run_p.sh` 和 `run_d.sh` 中，保留 [第 5.3 节](#glm53-flash-5-3-a2) 的环境\n"
"    变量，并在 `exec vllm serve` 之前添加以下导出。将\n"
"    `<CONFIG_DIRECTORY>` 替换为包含该节点 `mooncake.json` 的绝对目录。"

msgid ""
"Replace the final `--kv-transfer-config` argument in `run_p.sh` with the\n"
"    following fragment. Keep the remaining Prefill flags from [Section 5.3](#glm53-flash-5-3-a2),\n"
"    including `--max-num-seqs 64`."
msgstr ""
"将 `run_p.sh` 中最后的 `--kv-transfer-config` 参数替换为\n"
"    以下片段。保留 [第 5.3 节](#glm53-flash-5-3-a2) 中其余的 Prefill 标志，\n"
"    包括 `--max-num-seqs 64`。"

msgid ""
"Replace the final `--kv-transfer-config` argument in `run_d.sh` with the\n"
"    following fragment. Keep the remaining Decode flags from [Section 5.3](#glm53-flash-5-3-a2),\n"
"    including `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` graph mode and the MTP configuration."
msgstr ""
"将 `run_d.sh` 中最后的 `--kv-transfer-config` 参数替换为\n"
"    以下片段。保留 [第 5.3 节](#glm53-flash-5-3-a2) 中其余的 Decode 标志，\n"
"    包括 `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` 图模式以及 MTP 配置。"

msgid ""
"2. Start D0 and D1 with the [launcher commands from Section 5.3](#glm53-flash-a2-decode-command)\n"
"       (`--dp-rank-start 0` and `4`; four engines per node on ports\n"
"       `9900-9903`). Wait until all eight Decode engines answer\n"
"       `curl /v1/models`.\n"
"    3. Start P0 and P1 with the [launcher commands from Section 5.3](#glm53-flash-a2-prefill-command)\n"
"       (`--dp-rank-start 0` and `1`; P0 serves the API endpoint on port\n"
"       `9081`, while P1 is headless). Wait until the P0 API endpoint is\n"
"       ready and P1 logs confirm successful initialization.\n"
"    4. Start the [A2 series proxy from Section 5.3](#glm53-flash-a2-proxy). Send inference requests to\n"
"       `<PREFILL_NODE0_IP>:8081` using the examples in [Section 6](#6-functional-verification)."
msgstr ""
"2. 使用 [第 5.3 节中的启动器命令](#glm53-flash-a2-decode-command)\n"
"       启动 D0 和 D1（`--dp-rank-start 0` 和 `4`；每个节点四个引擎，端口\n"
"       `9900-9903`）。等待全部八个 Decode 引擎响应\n"
"       `curl /v1/models`。\n"
"    3. 使用 [第 5.3 节中的启动器命令](#glm53-flash-a2-prefill-command)\n"
"       启动 P0 和 P1（`--dp-rank-start 0` 和 `1`；P0 在端口\n"
"       `9081` 上提供 API 端点，而 P1 为无头模式）。等待 P0 API 端点\n"
"       就绪，并且 P1 日志确认初始化成功。\n"
"    4. 启动 [第 5.3 节中的 Atlas A2系列产品代理](#glm53-flash-a2-proxy)。使用 [第 6 节](#6-functional-verification) 中的示例\n"
"       向 `<PREFILL_NODE0_IP>:8081` 发送推理请求。"

msgid ""
"Follow the [A3 KV Cache reuse verification steps](#glm53-flash-pool-reuse). The proxy\n"
"    sends requests to the P0 API while the DP group uses both Prefill ranks. A\n"
"    repeated request can hit a local prefix cache, so confirm pool load/hit\n"
"    information on the other Prefill rank to verify shared pool reuse."
msgstr ""
"按照 [A3 KV Cache 复用验证步骤](#glm53-flash-pool-reuse) 进行操作。代理\n"
"    将请求发送到 P0 API，而 DP 组使用两个 Prefill rank。重复的请求可能命中\n"
"    本地前缀缓存，因此请确认另一个 Prefill rank 上的池加载/命中信息，以验证\n"
"    共享池复用。"

msgid "## 6 Functional Verification {: #6-functional-verification }"
msgstr "## 6 功能验证 {: #6-functional-verification }"

msgid ""
"Expected Result:\n"
"The response is a JSON payload containing the model's generated text in a text_completion format."
msgstr ""
"预期结果：\n"
"响应是一个 JSON 载荷，其中以 text_completion 格式包含模型生成的文本。"

msgid ""
"For common environment, installation, and general parameter issues, please "
"refer to the [Public FAQs](../../faqs.md); this chapter only covers model-"
"specific issues."
msgstr "关于常见环境、安装和通用参数问题，请参阅[公共常见问题](../../faqs.md)；本章仅涵盖模型相关问题。"

